{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01F8DMpkHHisXQ98ULd2wH9B","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Found Experiment Plan File\n\nI found **one file** related to experiment plans in the directory:\n\n**File Path:** `/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_11/projects/redundancy-compound-sparsity/experiment_plan.yaml`\n\n### Full Content:\n\n```yaml\n# Experiment Plan — Confound Resolution Phase\n# Last updated: 2026-05-12 (D005: MLA misidentification, reasoning vs instruction confound)\n# Target: EMNLP 2026 ARR (DDL: 2026-05-25)\n# NOTE: D004 MLA narrative SUSPENDED — DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B is GQA not MLA\n\nexperiments:\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # COMPLETED: MVP + cross-model validation\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - plan_id: mvp-001\n    registry_id: mvp-001\n    name: \"MVP: adjacent-sim baseline (invalid EMA)\"\n    status: DONE\n    result: \"r=-0.186, Δpert=-1.5%, FAIL (wrong impl)\"\n\n  - plan_id: mvp-001b\n    registry_id: mvp-001b\n    name: \"MVP: DeepSeek-R1-7B anchor EMA (easy problems)\"\n    claim: \"Claim 1 (MLA side)\"\n    status: DONE\n    result: \"r=+0.147, Δpert=-2.2%, FAIL on MLA\"\n\n  - plan_id: mvp-001c\n    registry_id: mvp-001c\n    name: \"MVP: DeepSeek-R1-7B anchor EMA (AIME hard problems)\"\n    claim: \"Claim 1 (MLA side, difficulty confound)\"\n    status: DONE\n    result: \"r=+0.159, Δpert=-1.2%, FAIL on MLA — difficulty doesn't matter\"\n\n  - plan_id: neg-cross-model-001\n    registry_id: neg-cross-model-001\n    name: \"Llama-3.1-8B anchor EMA validation\"\n    claim: \"Claim 1 (GQA side — POSITIVE)\"\n    status: DONE\n    result: \"r=+0.471, Δpert=+6.6%, hypothesis HOLDS on GQA\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P0-URGENT: Confound resolution (D005)\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - plan_id: confound-ctrl-001\n    name: \"Confound control: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-8B (same arch + reasoning)\"\n    claim: \"Confound resolution: architecture vs reasoning training\"\n    priority: P0-URGENT\n    description: |\n      Perfect control: same Llama GQA architecture as Llama-3.1-8B +\n      same reasoning distillation as DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B.\n      If r~0.15 → reasoning training is confound, D004 fails.\n      If r~0.47 → architecture (KV head count / group ratio) matters.\n      Run identical protocol to neg-cross-model-001 (20 problems, 55% sparsity, γ=0.99).\n    model: \"deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-8B\"\n    gpu_hours: 2\n    depends_on: [neg-cross-model-001]\n    status: PLANNED\n\n  - plan_id: confound-ctrl-002\n    name: \"Confound control: Qwen2-7B-Instruct (same arch + instruction)\"\n    claim: \"Confound resolution: architecture vs reasoning training\"\n    priority: P0\n    description: |\n      Second control: same Qwen2 GQA architecture as DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B +\n      instruction training. If r~0.47 → Qwen2 arch is fine, reasoning is confound.\n    model: \"Qwen/Qwen2-7B-Instruct\"\n    gpu_hours: 2\n    depends_on: [mvp-001b]\n    status: PLANNED\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P0: Core experiments (narrative TBD after confound resolution)\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - plan_id: llama-sparsity-sweep\n    name: \"Llama sparsity level sweep: push Δpert higher\"\n    claim: \"Claim 1, 3 (strengthen GQA positive evidence)\"\n    priority: P0\n    description: |\n      Test higher sparsity on Llama: {50%, 55%, 60%, 65%, 70%}.\n      Current Δpert=+6.6% at 55%. Higher sparsity may widen the gap\n      between redundant and novel tokens.\n    model: \"meta-llama/Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct\"\n    gpu_hours: 4\n    depends_on: [neg-cross-model-001]\n    status: PLANNED\n\n  - plan_id: llama-layer-analysis\n    name: \"Llama per-layer r + Δpert decomposition\"\n    claim: \"Claim 3 (per-layer architecture comparison)\"\n    priority: P0\n    description: |\n      Per-layer analysis on Llama data (from neg-cross-model-001).\n      Compare with DeepSeek per-layer profile.\n      Key question: do all layers show positive signal on GQA, or concentrated?\n    gpu_hours: 1\n    depends_on: [neg-cross-model-001]\n    status: PLANNED\n\n  - plan_id: kv-bench-001\n    registry_id: kv-bench-001\n    name: \"KV eviction benchmark: CARC-KV vs baselines\"\n    claim: \"Claim 4 (O(1) KV eviction)\"\n    priority: P0\n    description: |\n      CARC-KV (O(1)) vs H2O (O(n)) vs SnapKV vs StreamingLLM.\n      KV budgets {30%, 50%, 70%}. Eval: perplexity + accuracy.\n    model: \"deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B\"\n    gpu_hours: 20\n    depends_on: []\n    status: PREPARING\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P1: Strengthen architecture-dependence narrative\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - plan_id: cross-arch-mistral\n    name: \"Mistral-7B validation (2nd GQA model)\"\n    claim: \"Claim 1 (GQA generalization)\"\n    priority: P1\n    description: |\n      Repeat validation on Mistral-7B-Instruct (standard GQA).\n      Confirms GQA positive is not Llama-specific.\n    model: \"mistralai/Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.3\"\n    gpu_hours: 6\n    depends_on: [neg-cross-model-001]\n    status: PLANNED\n\n  - plan_id: mla-signal-analysis\n    name: \"MLA latent space semantic fidelity analysis\"\n    claim: \"Claim 2 (mechanistic: why MLA breaks signal)\"\n    priority: SUSPENDED\n    description: |\n      SUSPENDED (D005): DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B is NOT MLA.\n      No MLA model available to analyze. Reactivate only if a true MLA\n      model (DeepSeek-V2/V3) becomes testable.\n    gpu_hours: 4\n    depends_on: [mvp-001b, neg-cross-model-001]\n    status: SUSPENDED\n\n  - plan_id: kv-eviction-wallclock\n    name: \"Wall-clock: O(1) vs O(n) eviction cost\"\n    claim: \"Claim 4\"\n    priority: P1\n    description: |\n      Eviction overhead timing at L={4K, 8K, 16K, 32K}.\n      CARC-KV O(1) vs H2O O(n).\n    gpu_hours: 10\n    depends_on: [kv-bench-001]\n    status: PLANNED\n\n  - plan_id: neg-per-head\n    name: \"Per-head KV contribution analysis\"\n    claim: \"Claim 2, 3 (is it just head count 4 vs 8?)\"\n    priority: P1\n    description: |\n      Normalize per-head signal contribution.\n      DeepSeek: 4 KV heads, Llama: 8 KV heads.\n      Test: even per-head, does GQA show stronger signal?\n    gpu_hours: 2\n    depends_on: [mvp-001b, neg-cross-model-001]\n    status: PLANNED\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P2: Extensions\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - plan_id: kv-eviction-ablation\n    name: \"KV eviction: key-only vs key+value anchor\"\n    claim: \"Claim 4\"\n    priority: P2\n    gpu_hours: 5\n    depends_on: [kv-bench-001]\n    status: PLANNED\n\n  - plan_id: llama-downstream\n    name: \"Llama two-tier sparsity downstream accuracy\"\n    claim: \"Claim 1 (practical value of cross-axis on GQA)\"\n    priority: P2\n    description: |\n      Apply CARC two-tier MLP sparsity on Llama: 55% redundant / 40% novel.\n      Compare accuracy vs uniform sparsity on MATH problems.\n    gpu_hours: 6\n    depends_on: [llama-sparsity-sweep]\n    status: PLANNED\n\n# ============================================================\n# Timeline (12-day sprint, 5/12 → 5/25)\n# ============================================================\n# Day 1 (5/12): llama-sparsity-sweep + llama-layer-analysis (CPU)\n# Day 1-3: kv-bench-001 (parallel after sparsity sweep)\n# Day 2-4: cross-arch-mistral (download + run)\n# Day 3-5: mla-signal-analysis + neg-per-head\n# Day 4-7: kv-eviction-wallclock\n# Day 6-12: paper writing (parallel with P2)\n```\n\nThis is a comprehensive experiment plan for a machine learning research project on redundancy and compound sparsity,