arsity on MATH problems.\n    gpu_hours: 6\n    depends_on: [llama-sparsity-sweep]\n    status: PLANNED\n\n# ============================================================\n# Timeline (12-day sprint, 5/12 → 5/25)\n# ============================================================\n# Day 1 (5/12): llama-sparsity-sweep + llama-layer-analysis (CPU)\n# Day 1-3: kv-bench-001 (parallel after sparsity sweep)\n# Day 2-4: cross-arch-mistral (download + run)\n# Day 3-5: mla-signal-analysis + neg-per-head\n# Day 4-7: kv-eviction-wallclock\n# Day 6-12: paper writing (parallel with P2)\n```\n\nThis is a comprehensive experiment plan for a machine learning research project on redundancy and compound sparsity, with a target deadline of EMNLP 2026 (May 25, 2026). It includes completed MVP experiments, urgent confound resolution experiments, core P0 experiments, and P1-P2 extension experiments organized by priority."}],"totalDurationMs":28497,"totalTokens":26378,"totalToolUseCount":5,"usage":{"input_tokens":5,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8033,"cache_read_input_tokens":15664,"output_tokens":2676,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":8033},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":5,"output_tokens":2676,"cache_read_input_tokens":15664,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8033,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":8033,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"toolStats":{"readCount":1,"searchCount":3,"bashCount":1,"editFileCount":0,"linesAdded":0,"linesRemoved":0,"otherToolCount":0}}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_013WJmMKtD4p5QmuzGuCUNwd","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have the full experiment plan. I need to generate detailed predicted data for each PLANNED experiment under the \"worst\" tier scenario. Let me go through each planned experiment and create predictions.\n\nThe \"worst\" tier means:\n- Mistral-7B doesn't replicate GQA signal → signal is Llama-specific\n- High sparsity doesn't help on Llama\n- MLA analysis is inconclusive\n- Cross-axis signal is fragile/Llama-specific\n\nLet me list all PLANNED experiments:\n1. confound-ctrl-001: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-8B\n\n\n2. confound-ctrl-002: Qwen2-7B-Instruct\n3. llama-sparsity-sweep: Llama sparsity {50%, 55%, 60%, 65%, 70%}\n4. llama-layer-analysis: Per-layer decomposition\n5. kv-bench-001: KV eviction benchmark (PREPARING/RUNNING)\n6. cross-arch-mistral: Mistral-7B validation\n7. mla-signal-analysis: SUSPENDED\n8. kv-eviction-wallclock: Wall-clock timing\n9. neg-per-head: Per-head analysis\n10. kv-eviction-ablation: Key-only vs key+value\n11. llama-downstream: Two-tier sparsity downstream\n\nNow I'm working through worst-case scenarios for each experiment. Looking at the bounds: Mistral correlations hover around 0.05-0.25 with perturbation deltas between -3.0 and 1.5 at 55% sparsity, Llama shows wider variance across sparsity levels, and MLA's effective rank ratio stays in the 0.45-0.7 range. For confound-ctrl-001 specifically, if reasoning training is actually the confounding factor rather than the architecture itself, the correlation would drop significantly to around 0.18 with minimal perturbation effect.\n\nAcross the other control experiments, the signal appears fragile—Qwen2 with instruction tuning shows similarly weak correlation around 0.12, while the Llama sparsity sweep reveals the effect actually degrades at higher sparsity levels rather than amplifying, peaking around 55-60% before declining. The per-layer analysis suggests the signal concentrates in just a subset of layers rather than distributing uniformly across the model.\n\nThe cross-architecture test with Mistral is the critical failure point—barely any signal replicates there. KV eviction timing might still show the expected O(1) advantage independent of these architectural concerns, though the MLA signal analysis remains inconclusive if attempted at all.\n\nLooking at the per-head breakdown, the Llama results appear driven by specific heads rather than a general GQA property, and the key-only versus key-value ablation shows only moderate differences. Two-tier sparsity on Llama doesn't seem to outperform uniform sparsity in the worst case scenario.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2927,"cache_read_input_tokens":20762,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2927},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"705bf039-efbf-40c4-8c0f-f3619177ef59","uuid":"a715035a-91bb-4083-b395-616c574afd9d"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_013WJmMKtD4p5QmuzGuCUNwd","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: worst\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  从 method/finding paper 重构为 analysis/negative-result paper。\n  Title 转向：\"Limits of Cross-Axis Redundancy Signals: A Multi-Model Analysis\"。\n  核心叙事：cross-axis coordination 的 assumption 比预期脆弱，即使在同一 attention family 内也不稳定——\n  Llama-3.1-8B 的正信号是该模型的 idiosyncrasy 而非 GQA 的 generic property。\n  Mistral-7B 不复现、高稀疏度无放大、confound control 模糊了 architecture 和 training 的边界。\n  Salvage 策略：(1) 严格 hypothesis testing protocol 作为方法论贡献，\n  (2) per-layer/per-problem fragility 分析本身有价值，\n  (3) O(1) KV eviction 作为独立贡献脱离 cross-axis story。\n  投稿：EMNLP Findings 或 workshop paper。若 kv-bench-001 强则 pivot 为 KV eviction method paper + cross-axis negative appendix。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P0-URGENT: Confound Resolution\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - name: \"Confound control: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-8B\"\n    plan_id: confound-ctrl-001\n    description: >\n      Same Llama GQA architecture + reasoning distillation training。\n      如果 r 下降至 ~0.15-0.20，说明 reasoning training 改变了 token-level redundancy pattern，\n      即使架构不变信号也被破坏——architecture 叙事被 confound。\n    expected_results:\n      pearson_r: 0.19\n      pearson_p: 0.0\n      dpert_40pct: -0.3\n      dpert_55pct: -0.8\n      per_problem_r_range: [0.05, 0.32]\n      ks_L0: 0.24\n      ks_L2: 0.19\n      ks_L4: 0.17\n      verdict: FAIL\n      total_tokens: 38500\n      num_problems: 20\n      elapsed_s: 950\n    result_rationale: >\n      Reasoning distillation 改变了 token 生成分布：长 thinking chain 中大量 meta-cognitive token\n      （\"wait\"、\"let me reconsider\"、\"alternatively\"）的 KV representation 不遵循 instruction-tuned\n      模型中 content token 的 redundancy pattern。Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct 的正信号依赖于 instruction\n      training 产生的 compact token distribution——reasoning distillation 引入大量 exploratory token\n      打破了 \"高 KV similarity → 低 surprisal\" 的链条。r 从 0.47 降至 0.19 说明 training paradigm\n      而非 architecture 是决定性因素。Δpert 转负是因为 reasoning model 的 high-similarity token\n      实际上是 meta-cognitive transition token（如 \"hmm, but\"），这些 token 的 MLP activation\n      对下游 reasoning 路径至关重要，pruning 它们反而导致 accuracy 下降。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: confound-ctrl-001 vs neg-cross-model-001\"\n        content: |\n          | Model                        | Arch | Training    | r     | Δpert@55% | Verdict |\n          |------------------------------|------|-------------|-------|-----------|---------|\n          | Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct        | GQA  | Instruction | 0.471 | +6.6%     | PASS    |\n          | DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-8B | GQA  | Reasoning   | 0.19  | -0.8%     | FAIL    |\n          | DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B  | GQA  | Reasoning   | 0.147 | -2.2%     | FAIL    |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Scatter: per-problem r (x) vs Δpert (y)，三个模型用不同 marker。Llama cluster 在右上，两个 reasoning model cluster 在左下/中部，说明 training paradigm 比 architecture 更具解释力。\"\n    analysis: >\n      致命发现：同一 GQA 架构在不同 training paradigm 下 r 差异 >0.25。\n      这意味着 D004 的 \"GQA positive\" 结论是 Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct 的 specific property，\n      不是 GQA architecture 的 generic property。Architecture-dependence narrative 崩塌——\n      真正的 confound 是 instruction vs reasoning training，不是 GQA vs MLA。\n      后续只能将 Llama 正信号作为一个 interesting data point，不能作为 architectural claim。\n\n  - name: \"Confound control: Qwen2-7B-Instruct\"\n    plan_id: confound-ctrl-002\n    description: >\n      Same Qwen2 GQA architecture as DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B + instruction training (non-reasoning)。\n      测试 Qwen2 架构本身是否支持 cross-axis signal。\n    expected_results:\n      pearson_r: 0.22\n      pearson_p: 0.0\n      dpert_40pct: 0.5\n      dpert_55pct: 1.2\n      per_problem_r_range: [0.02, 0.38]\n      ks_L0: 0.22\n      ks_L2: 0.16\n      ks_L4: 0.15\n      verdict: FAIL\n      num_problems: 20\n      elapsed_s: 880\n    result_rationale: >\n      Qwen2-7B-Instruct 使用 GQA（28 query heads / 4 KV heads, group ratio = 7），\n      KV head count 仅 4 个（vs Llama 8 个），每个 KV head 需要 serve 更多 query head。\n      这导致 KV representation 被迫更加 \"generic\"——cosine similarity 在高 group ratio 下\n      丢失 token-specific 信息。r=0.22 和 Δpert=+1.2% 虽然方向正确但 effect size 不显著，\n      per-problem variance 极大（range [-0.02, 0.38]）说明信号不稳定。\n      这进一步支持了信号是 model-specific 而非 architecture-generic 的结论：\n      即使都是 GQA + instruction training，Llama 和 Qwen2 的结果差异仍然很大。\n      关键区别可能在于 KV head count（8 vs 4）和 hidden dim ratio。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: GQA instruction models comparison\"\n        content: |\n          | Model                 | KV Heads | Group Ratio | r     | Δpert@55% | Stable? |\n          |-----------------------|----------|-------------|-------|-----------|---------|\n          | Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct | 8        | 4           | 0.471 | +6.6%     | Yes     |\n          | Qwen2-7B-Instruct     | 4        | 7           | 0.22  | +1.2%     | No      |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: r 和 Δpert@55% 对比，Llama vs Qwen2 vs DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen vs DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama。四个 model 的信号强度差异无法用单一因素（arch 或 training）解释。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Qwen2 instruction model r=0.22 远低于 Llama instruction model r=0.47。\n      同为 GQA + instruction，信号强度差 2x+，说明 cross-axis signal 对 model-specific 因素\n      （KV head count、hidden dim、pretraining data 分布）极其敏感。\n      即使忽略 reasoning confound，signal 的 model-specificity 也使 architectural claim 站不住脚。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P0: Core Experiments\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - name: \"Llama sparsity level sweep\"\n    plan_id: llama-sparsity-sweep\n    description: >\n      在 Llama-3.1-8B 上测试 {50%, 55%, 60%, 65%, 70%} sparsity level。\n      worst 档预期：高稀疏度下 model 崩溃，Δpert 不增反降。\n    expected_results:\n      dpert_50pct: 5.8\n      dpert_55pct: 6.5\n      dpert_60pct: 5.2\n      dpert_65pct: 4.1\n      dpert_70pct: 1.8\n      r_50pct: 0.46\n      r_55pct: 0.47\n      r_60pct: 0.43\n      r_65pct: 0.38\n      r_70pct: 0.29\n      accuracy_uniform_70pct: 0.18\n      accuracy_guided_70pct: 0.20\n      accuracy_baseline: 0.65\n      num_problems: 20\n    result_rationale: >\n      高稀疏度（≥65%）时 MLP pruning 开始切入 critical neurons——无论 token 是否 redundant，\n      保留的 neuron 数量不足以维持 reasoning chain 的 coherence。在 70% sparsity 下\n      uniform 和 guided 的 accuracy 都崩溃至 ~0.20（baseline 0.65），Δpert 仅 +1.8%\n      说明 \"redundant token 更 tolerant\" 的 margin 在模型整体崩溃时被压缩。\n      correlation r 从 0.47 降至 0.29 是因为在极高 sparsity 下，所有 token 的 MLP output\n      都被严重扰动，noise 淹没了 signal——KV similarity 不再有区分力。\n      关键问题：Δpert 的 peak 在 55% 而非更高，说明 signal 的 practical operating range 很窄，\n      这削弱了 \"cross-axis coordination 在实际部署中有用\" 的论点。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Llama-3.1-8B sparsity sweep\"\n        content: |\n          | Sparsity | r     | Δpert (%)  | Acc (uniform) | Acc (guided) | Acc (base) |\n          |----------|-------|------------|---------------|--------------|------------|\n          | 50%      | 0.46  | +5.8       | 0.52          | 0.55         | 0.65       |\n          | 55%      | 0.47  | +6.5       | 0.46          | 0.49         | 0.65       |\n          | 60%      | 0.43  | +5.2       | 0.38          | 0.40         | 0.65       |\n          | 65%      | 0.38  | +4.1       | 0.28          | 0.29         | 0.65       |\n          | 70%      | 0.29  | +1.8       | 0.18          | 0.20         | 0.65       |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Line plot: x=sparsity level, y=Δpert(%)，标注 peak 在 55%。Overlay 第二 y-axis 画 r 的下降趋势。shaded region 标注 'model collapse zone' (≥65%)。\"\n      - \"Line plot: x=sparsity level, y=accuracy。三条线：baseline（flat 0.65）, uniform sparsity, guided sparsity。两条 sparsity 线在 65%+ 急剧下降并趋近，gap 收窄。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Δpert 在 55% 达到 peak (+6.5%) 然后单调下降。这意味着 cross-axis signal 的 practical\n      operating range 仅在 50-60% 的窄 window 内有意义。超过 65% 模型本身崩溃，\n      redundant 和 novel token 的区分变得 irrelevant。这对 paper narrative 有两重打击：\n      (1) 高稀疏度没有放大效应，reviewer 会质疑 practical value，\n      (2) 在 70% sparsity 下 guided 仅比 uniform 好 2 个百分点（0.20 vs 0.18），\n      在模型已经无法 reasoning 的情况下这个差异无意义。\n\n  - name: \"Llama per-layer r + Δpert decomposition\"\n    plan_id: llama-layer-analysis\n    description: >\n      Llama-3.1-8B 的 32 层逐层分析 r 和 Δpert。\n      worst 档预期：信号高度集中在少数层，不是 uniform pattern。\n    expected_results:\n      layers_with_r_above_0.4: 9\n      layers_with_r_below_0.2: 12\n      peak_layer_r: 0.68\n      peak_layer_id: 14\n      dpert_concentrated_in_layers: \"12-18\"\n      layer_r_std: 0.18\n      median_layer_r: 0.31\n    result_rationale: >\n      Cross-axis signal 集中在 middle layers (12-18) 是因为这些层对应 \"compositional reasoning\"\n      的计算——early layers 做 token mixing（KV similarity 不反映 semantic redundancy），\n      late layers 做 output projection（MLP 对所有 token 都 critical）。\n      32 层中仅 9 层 r>0.4 说明 aggregate r=0.47 是被少数高信号层 dominate 的 artifact。\n      12 层 r<0.2 说明在 early 和 late layers，KV similarity 和 MLP sparsity tolerance\n      是 decorrelated 的——cross-axis hypothesis 在这些层不成立。\n      layer-level variance (std=0.18) 很高，说明 signal 不是 architecturally uniform property，\n      而是 layer-specific computation 的 byproduct。\n      这进一步说明即使在 Llama 上，cross-axis coordination 的适用范围也比 paper 宣称的更窄。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Per-layer r distribution summary\"\n        content: |\n          | Layer Group | Layers  | Mean r | Mean Δpert@55% | Signal?    |\n          |-------------|---------|--------|----------------|------------|\n          | Early       | 0-7     | 0.15   | +1.2%          | Weak/None  |\n          | Early-Mid   | 8-11    | 0.32   | +3.8%          | Moderate   |\n          | Middle      | 12-18   | 0.62   | +11.4%         | Strong     |\n          | Late-Mid    | 19-25   | 0.38   | +5.1%          | Moderate   |\n          | Late        | 26-31   | 0.18   | +2.0%          | Weak       |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Heatmap: 32 rows (layers) x 20 columns (problems)，cell value = layer-level r。Middle layers 明显更亮（r>0.5），early/late 暗（r<0.2）。标注 'signal concentrated in layers 12-18'。\"\n      - \"Bar chart: per-layer Δpert@55%。Middle layers bar 明显高于 early/late。Error bars 显示 per-problem variance。\"\n    analysis: >\n      信号的 layer concentration 是 worst 档的关键证据之一。如果 cross-axis coordination\n      是 GQA 的 generic architectural property，它应该在所有层 reasonably uniform。\n      实际上只有 7/32 层（22%）有 strong signal，说明这更可能是 Llama middle-layer\n      specific computation pattern 的 byproduct，不是可以 generalize 的 architectural insight。\n      对 paper narrative：可以作为 \"where the signal lives and where it doesn't\" 的 fine-grained\n      分析，但这实际上是在 undermining 自己的 main claim。\n\n  - name: \"KV eviction benchmark: CARC-KV vs baselines\"\n    plan_id: kv-bench-001\n    description: >\n      CARC-KV O(1) vs H2O O(n) vs SnapKV vs StreamingLLM。\n      KV budgets {30%, 50%, 70%}。Eval: perplexity + accuracy。\n      worst 档下 KV eviction 是 salvage 的关键——结果需要至少 competitive。\n    expected_results:\n      carc_kv_acc_30pct: 0.42\n      carc_kv_acc_50pct: 0.58\n      carc_kv_acc_70pct: 0.63\n      h2o_acc_30pct: 0.44\n      h2o_acc_50pct: 0.59\n      h2o_acc_70pct: 0.64\n      snapkv_acc_30pct: 0.46\n      snapkv_acc_50pct: 0.60\n      snapkv_acc_70pct: 0.64\n      streaming_acc_30pct: 0.31\n      streaming_acc_50pct: 0.45\n      streaming_acc_70pct: 0.55\n      carc_kv_ppl_50pct: 8.2\n      h2o_ppl_50pct: 7.9\n      snapkv_ppl_50pct: 7.6\n      streaming_ppl_50pct: 12.1\n      baseline_acc: 0.65\n      baseline_ppl: 6.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      CARC-KV 使用 O(1) EMA anchor similarity 做 eviction，计算成本远低于 H2O（需要\n      cumulative attention score O(n) 维护）和 SnapKV（需要 observation window scoring）。\n      在 worst 档下，CARC-KV 的 accuracy 比 H2O 低 1-2 个百分点、比 SnapKV 低 2-4 个百分点，\n      因为 EMA similarity 不如 attention-based importance score 精确——它是 representation\n      空间的 proxy，不直接反映 attention weight。但 CARC-KV 在所有 budget 下都大幅优于\n      StreamingLLM（+8-13 百分点），因为 StreamingLLM 的 sliding window + sink 策略\n      无法保留 long-range dependencies。CARC-KV 的 competitive-but-not-SOTA 结果\n      在 worst 档下刚好够支撑 \"O(1) eviction as standalone contribution\" 的叙事，\n      但不足以作为 paper 的 primary contribution。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: KV eviction accuracy by budget\"\n        content: |\n          | Method       | Complexity | 30% Budget | 50% Budget | 70% Budget |\n          |-------------|------------|------------|------------|------------|\n          | Full KV      | —          | —          | —          | 0.65       |\n          | CARC-KV      | O(1)       | 0.42       | 0.58       | 0.63       |\n          | H2O          | O(n)       | 0.44       | 0.59       | 0.64       |\n          | SnapKV       | O(n)       | 0.46       | 0.60       | 0.64       |\n          | StreamingLLM | O(1)       | 0.31       | 0.45       | 0.55       |\n      - name: \"Table: KV eviction perplexity at 50% budget\"\n        content: |\n          | Method       | PPL   | ΔPPL vs full |\n          |-------------|-------|--------------|\n          | Full KV      | 6.8   | —            |\n          | CARC-KV      | 8.2   | +1.4         |\n          | H2O          | 7.9   | +1.1         |\n          | SnapKV       | 7.6   | +0.8         |\n          | StreamingLLM | 12.1  | +5.3         |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart grouped by KV budget (30/50/70%)，每组四个 bar（四个 method），y=accuracy。Dashed line 标注 full KV baseline。CARC-KV 紧跟 H2O/SnapKV，StreamingLLM 明显落后。\"\n      - \"Line plot: x=KV budget (%), y=perplexity。四条线。标注 CARC-KV 和 H2O 的 gap 在 70% budget 时 converge。\"\n    analysis: >\n      CARC-KV 在 accuracy 上比 H2O/SnapKV 差 1-4 个百分点但 complexity 低一个 order。\n      这是一个 reasonable tradeoff 但不是 breakthrough。在 worst 档的 narrative 下，\n      KV eviction 是唯一可以独立成立的贡献，但需要强调 O(1) 的 latency 优势\n      （在 kv-eviction-wallclock 中展示）来弥补 accuracy gap。\n      如果 KV eviction 要作为 paper 的 primary contribution，需要在 wall-clock 上有 compelling\n      的优势（≥3x speedup at long context）。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P1: Architecture-dependence (in worst tier, these UNDERMINE the narrative)\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - name: \"Mistral-7B validation (2nd GQA model)\"\n    plan_id: cross-arch-mistral\n    description: >\n      Repeat cross-axis protocol on Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.3。\n      worst 档核心假设：Mistral 不复现信号，r<0.25，Δpert 接近 0 或负。\n    expected_results:\n      pearson_r: 0.13\n      pearson_p: 0.0\n      dpert_40pct: -1.2\n      dpert_55pct: 0.8\n      per_problem_r_range: [-0.05, 0.28]\n      per_problem_r_std: 0.09\n      ks_L0: 0.26\n      ks_L2: 0.21\n      ks_L4: 0.18\n      verdict: FAIL\n      total_tokens: 14200\n      num_problems: 20\n      elapsed_s: 720\n    result_rationale: >\n      Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.3 使用 GQA（8 KV heads, group ratio = 4，与 Llama 相同），\n      但 sliding window attention (SWA) 改变了 KV cache 的 information structure。\n      SWA 限制 attention span 至 4096 tokens，导致 EMA anchor（从 position 0 开始累积）\n      在超过 window size 后失去对 recent context 的代表性。Mistral 的 KV similarity\n      分布因此与 Llama 的 full attention 完全不同：early token 的 anchor 无法 capture\n      late token 的 semantic content，cosine similarity 退化为 noise。\n      r=0.13 和 per-problem range [-0.05, 0.28] 说明信号不存在——部分 problem 甚至\n      出现 negative correlation。Δpert@55% = +0.8% 虽然方向正确但在 noise margin 内。\n      结论：即使 GQA head configuration 完全相同，attention mechanism 的差异\n      （full attention vs SWA）就足以破坏 cross-axis signal。\n      这是 worst 档叙事的核心证据：signal 是 Llama-3.1-8B-specific，不是 GQA-generic。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: GQA models comparison — full picture\"\n        content: |\n          | Model                        | KV Heads | Attn Type | Training    | r     | Δpert@55% |\n          |------------------------------|----------|-----------|-------------|-------|-----------|\n          | Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct        | 8        | Full      | Instruction | 0.471 | +6.6%     |\n          | DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-8B | 8        | Full      | Reasoning   | 0.19  | -0.8%     |\n          | Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.3     | 8        | SWA       | Instruction | 0.13  | +0.8%     |\n          | Qwen2-7B-Instruct            | 4        | Full      | Instruction | 0.22  | +1.2%     |\n          | DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B  | 4        | Full      | Reasoning   | 0.147 | -2.2%     |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Scatter: x=r, y=Δpert@55%。5 个 model 的 data points，only Llama-3.1-8B in upper-right quadrant。其余 4 个 clustered near origin。Clear outlier pattern。\"\n      - \"Violin plot: per-problem r 分布对比 Llama vs Mistral。Llama tight cluster [0.42, 0.49]，Mistral spread [-0.05, 0.28] with median ~0.12。\"\n    analysis: >\n      这是 architecture-dependence 叙事的致命实验。Mistral 和 Llama 有完全相同的\n      GQA head configuration（8 KV heads, group ratio = 4），但 Mistral 不复现信号。\n      结合 confound-ctrl-001 和 confound-ctrl-002 的结果，5 个 model 中只有\n      Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct 展示 strong signal。这不可能用 \"architecture-dependent\" 解释——\n      必须承认信号是 model-specific 的，可能取决于 pretraining data distribution、\n      attention pattern（full vs SWA）、和 post-training recipe 的 complex interaction。\n\n  - name: \"MLA latent space semantic fidelity analysis\"\n    plan_id: mla-signal-analysis\n    description: >\n      SUSPENDED (D005): DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B is GQA not MLA.\n      在 worst 档下，即使重新激活（如获得 DeepSeek-V2-Lite），分析也 inconclusive。\n    expected_results:\n      status: SUSPENDED\n      effective_rank_ratio_if_run: 0.55\n      latent_dim_vs_full_dim: \"512 / 4096 = 0.125\"\n      cosine_sim_preservation_ratio: 0.38\n      conclusion: \"inconclusive — cannot distinguish latent compression artifact from signal absence\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      实验被 suspend 因为 D005 发现 DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B 是 GQA 不是 MLA。\n      即使获得真正的 MLA 模型（如 DeepSeek-V2-Lite），worst 档预期：\n      effective rank ratio ~0.55 说明 latent space 确实有 compression，\n      但 cosine similarity preservation ratio 0.38 无法区分两种解释：\n      (a) latent compression 确实破坏了 semantic fidelity，或\n      (b) 信号本身在任何非 Llama 模型上都不存在，compression 只是 red herring。\n      由于其他 GQA 模型（Mistral、Qwen2）也 fail，(b) 成为更 parsimonious 的解释，\n      使得整个 MLA mechanistic analysis 变得 moot。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"如果执行：scatter plot of full-dim cosine sim vs latent-dim cosine sim，showing 0.38 preservation ratio。但由于 SUSPENDED，不会出现在 paper 中。\"\n    analysis: >\n      MLA 分析被 suspend 是 worst 档的一部分。D005 消除了 \"MLA vs GQA\" 的架构对比，\n      但 worst 档下即使恢复 MLA 分析，结论也无法挽救 paper：\n      问题从 \"GQA vs MLA\" 变成了 \"Llama vs everyone else\"，\n      MLA mechanistic explanation 变成了 unnecessary complexity。\n\n  - name: \"Wall-clock: O(1) vs O(n) eviction cost\"\n    plan_id: kv-eviction-wallclock\n    description: >\n      CARC-KV O(1) vs H2O O(n) eviction overhead at L={4K, 8K, 16K, 32K}。\n      worst 档下这是 KV eviction 作为独立贡献的关键支撑。\n    expected_results:\n      carc_kv_ms_4k: 0.8\n      carc_kv_ms_8k: 0.9\n      carc_kv_ms_16k: 1.0\n      carc_kv_ms_32k: 1.1\n      h2o_ms_4k: 2.1\n      h2o_ms_8k: 3.8\n      h2o_ms_16k: 7.2\n      h2o_ms_32k: 14.1\n      speedup_4k: 2.6\n      speedup_8k: 4.2\n      speedup_16k: 7.2\n      speedup_32k: 12.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      CARC-KV 的 eviction decision 是 O(1)：比较当前 token KV 与 EMA anchor 的 cosine sim，\n      一次 dot product + scalar comparison。H2O 需要 maintain cumulative attention score\n      across all cached tokens，每步 eviction 需要 argsort 或 partial sort。\n      在 L=4K 时 overhead 差异 modest（2.6x），因为 H2O 的 O(n) 在小 n 下常数小。\n      但 L=32K 时 H2O 的 per-step overhead 增长到 14.1ms（vs CARC-KV 1.1ms），\n      speedup 达到 12.8x。这个 scaling 优势是 worst 档下 paper 能 claim 的最 concrete 贡献。\n      注意：这是 per-step eviction overhead 而非 total inference time，\n      eviction 在 total inference 中占比取决于 sequence length 和 model size。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Per-step eviction overhead (ms)\"\n        content: |\n          | Seq Length | CARC-KV (ms) | H2O (ms) | Speedup |\n          |------------|-------------|----------|---------|\n          | 4K         | 0.8         | 2.1      | 2.6x    |\n          | 8K         | 0.9         | 3.8      | 4.2x    |\n          | 16K        | 1.0         | 7.2      | 7.2x    |\n          | 32K        | 1.1         | 14.1     | 12.8x   |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Log-scale line plot: x=sequence length, y=eviction overhead (ms)。CARC-KV flat line（~1ms constant），H2O linear growth。标注 crossover 和 speedup ratios。\"\n    analysis: >\n      O(1) vs O(n) scaling 是 clean 的结果，不受 cross-axis 叙事崩塌的影响。\n      12.8x speedup at 32K 是 compelling 的数字。但问题是：H2O 和 SnapKV 在 accuracy\n      上仍然略胜 CARC-KV（见 kv-bench-001），所以 tradeoff 是 \"速度 vs 精度\"。\n      对于 worst 档的 pivot narrative，KV eviction wall-clock 是最强的 standalone result，\n      但需要搭配 accuracy 数据一起呈现以保持 honesty。\n\n  - name: \"Per-head KV contribution analysis\"\n    plan_id: neg-per-head\n    description: >\n      Normalize per-head signal contribution。DeepSeek: 4 KV heads, Llama: 8 KV heads。\n    expected_results:\n      llama_per_head_r_mean: 0.41\n      llama_per_head_r_std: 0.12\n      llama_heads_with_r_above_0.4: 5\n      llama_heads_with_r_below_0.2: 1\n      deepseek_per_head_r_mean: 0.11\n      deepseek_per_head_r_std: 0.06\n      deepseek_heads_with_r_above_0.2: 0\n      per_head_normalized_gap: 0.30\n    result_rationale: >\n      Per-head 分析试图回答 \"Llama 的高 r 是否纯粹因为 8 heads 提供了更 fine-grained 信号\"。\n      worst 档预期：Llama 的 per-head r mean = 0.41（vs aggregate 0.47），说明 aggregation\n      没有大幅 inflate signal；但 per-head std = 0.12 说明不同 head 的 signal 强度差异大。\n      5/8 heads 有 r>0.4 说明信号不是 uniform across heads。1 head r<0.2 说明\n      至少一个 head 的 KV representation 不 capture semantic redundancy。\n      DeepSeek per-head r mean = 0.11 with std = 0.06 说明所有 4 heads 均无信号。\n      per-head normalized gap = 0.30 说明即使 normalize for head count，Llama 仍然\n      显著优于 DeepSeek，但这只是说 \"Llama 的 specific heads 有 signal\"，\n      结合 Mistral/Qwen2 结果，不能推广到 \"GQA heads have signal\"。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Per-head r analysis\"\n        content: |\n          | Model     | Head | r     | Signal |\n          |-----------|------|-------|--------|\n          | Llama     | H0   | 0.52  | Strong |\n          | Llama     | H1   | 0.48  | Strong |\n          | Llama     | H2   | 0.45  | Mod    |\n          | Llama     | H3   | 0.42  | Mod    |\n          | Llama     | H4   | 0.41  | Mod    |\n          | Llama     | H5   | 0.35  | Weak   |\n          | Llama     | H6   | 0.28  | Weak   |\n          | Llama     | H7   | 0.14  | None   |\n          | DeepSeek  | H0   | 0.15  | None   |\n          | DeepSeek  | H1   | 0.12  | None   |\n          | DeepSeek  | H2   | 0.09  | None   |\n          | DeepSeek  | H3   | 0.08  | None   |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Grouped bar chart: per-head r for Llama (8 bars) vs DeepSeek (4 bars)。Llama bars sorted descending, clear gradient from 0.52 to 0.14。DeepSeek all below 0.15。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Per-head 分析在 worst 档下变成了对 Llama signal fragility 的进一步证据：\n      即使在 Llama 内部，head 间的 signal 差异很大（H0=0.52 vs H7=0.14），\n      说明 cross-axis signal 不是 \"GQA KV representation 的 inherent property\"，\n      而是特定 head 在 Llama pretraining 中学到的 specific computation pattern。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P2: Extensions (worst tier — limited value)\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - name: \"KV eviction: key-only vs key+value anchor\"\n    plan_id: kv-eviction-ablation\n    description: >\n      Ablation: 只用 key vector 做 EMA anchor vs 用 concatenated key+value。\n    expected_results:\n      key_only_acc_50pct: 0.56\n      key_value_acc_50pct: 0.58\n      key_only_ppl_50pct: 8.6\n      key_value_ppl_50pct: 8.2\n      delta_acc: 0.02\n      delta_ppl: 0.4\n    result_rationale: >\n      Key-only 和 key+value anchor 的差异 modest（Δacc=0.02, ΔPPL=0.4）是因为\n      在 GQA 中 key 和 value 的 angular structure 高度 correlated——key 已经 capture\n      了 token identity 的大部分信息，value 的 marginal contribution 有限。\n      这对 paper 是 neutral result：使用 key+value 略好但不 significant，\n      说明 method 对这个 design choice 不 sensitive。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Key-only vs Key+Value ablation\"\n        content: |\n          | Anchor Type | Acc@50% | PPL@50% |\n          |-------------|---------|---------|\n          | Key-only    | 0.56    | 8.6     |\n          | Key+Value   | 0.58    | 8.2     |\n          | Δ           | +0.02   | -0.4    |\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      Low-impact ablation。在 worst 档下作为 appendix 材料，不影响 main narrative。\n\n  - name: \"Llama two-tier sparsity downstream accuracy\"\n    plan_id: llama-downstream\n    description: >\n      Apply CARC two-tier MLP sparsity on Llama: 55% redundant / 40% novel vs uniform 48%。\n      worst 档预期：guided 没有显著优势。\n    expected_results:\n      uniform_48pct_acc: 0.49\n      guided_55_40_acc: 0.50\n      delta_acc: 0.01\n      uniform_48pct_ppl: 7.8\n      guided_55_40_ppl: 7.7\n      baseline_acc: 0.65\n      num_problems: 20\n    result_rationale: >\n      Two-tier sparsity 的 premise 是 \"redundant token 可以 tolerate 更高 sparsity\"。\n      但 worst 档下 Δpert=+6.6% 是 aggregate statistic，per-problem variance 大\n      且 signal 集中在少数 layer——实际 guided allocation 在 per-token granularity 上\n      的优势被 noise 淹没。Δacc=+0.01（50% vs 49%）在统计上不显著（20 problems 的\n      binomial CI 约 ±0.07）。这直接削弱了 \"cross-axis coordination 有 practical value\"\n      的论点——即使在 signal 最强的 Llama 上，downstream task 也看不到 meaningful improvement。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Two-tier vs uniform sparsity on Llama\"\n        content: |\n          | Strategy                 | Avg Sparsity | Acc   | PPL  |\n          |--------------------------|-------------|-------|------|\n          | No sparsity (baseline)   | 0%          | 0.65  | 6.8  |\n          | Uniform 48%              | 48%         | 0.49  | 7.8  |\n          | Guided 55%/40%           | ~48%        | 0.50  | 7.7  |\n          | Δ (guided - uniform)     | —           | +0.01 | -0.1 |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: three bars (baseline, uniform, guided)，y=accuracy。Guided 和 uniform 几乎等高，与 baseline 差距大。标注 Δ=+0.01 (n.s.)。\"\n    analysis: >\n      这是 worst 档的 final nail：cross-axis signal 在 downstream task 上不产生\n      meaningful improvement。即使 correlation r=0.47 在 statistical sense 显著，\n      practical value 接近 zero。Paper 必须 honestly report 这个 null result，\n      进一步支持 negative-finding narrative。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2927,"cache_read_input_tokens":20762,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2927},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"705bf039-efbf-40c4-8c0f-f3619177ef59","uuid":"8e94d35f-6145-4253-bc45-5e03c8965eec"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":268924,"duration_api_ms":270652,"num_turns":2,"result":"```yaml\ntier: worst\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  从 method/finding paper 重构为 analysis/negative-result paper。\n  Title 转向：\"Limits of Cross-Axis Redundancy Signals: A Multi-Model Analysis\"。\n  核心叙事：cross-axis coordination 的 assumption 比预期脆弱，即使在同一 attention family 内也不稳定——\n  Llama-3.1-8B 的正信号是该模型的 idiosyncrasy 而非 GQA 的 generic property。\n  Mistral-7B 不复现、高稀疏度无放大、confound control 模糊了 architecture 和 training 的边界。\n  Salvage 策略：(1) 严格 hypothesis testing protocol 作为方法论贡献，\n  (2) per-layer/per-problem fragility 分析本身有价值，\n  (3) O(1) KV eviction 作为独立贡献脱离 cross-axis story。\n  投稿：EMNLP Findings 或 workshop paper。若 kv-bench-001 强则 pivot 为 KV eviction method paper + cross-axis negative appendix。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P0-URGENT: Confound Resolution\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - name: \"Confound control: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-8B\"\n    plan_id: confound-ctrl-001\n    description: >\n      Same Llama GQA architecture + reasoning distillation training。\n      如果 r 下降至 ~0.15-0.20，说明 reasoning training 改变了 token-level redundancy pattern，\n      即使架构不变信号也被破坏——architecture 叙事被 confound。\n    expected_results:\n      pearson_r: 0.19\n      pearson_p: 0.0\n      dpert_40pct: -0.3\n      dpert_55pct: -0.8\n      per_problem_r_range: [0.05, 0.32]\n      ks_L0: 0.24\n      ks_L2: 0.19\n      ks_L4: 0.17\n      verdict: FAIL\n      total_tokens: 38500\n      num_problems: 20\n      elapsed_s: 950\n    result_rationale: >\n      Reasoning distillation 改变了 token 生成分布：长 thinking chain 中大量 meta-cognitive token\n      （\"wait\"、\"let me reconsider\"、\"alternatively\"）的 KV representation 不遵循 instruction-tuned\n      模型中 content token 的 redundancy pattern。Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct 的正信号依赖于 instruction\n      training 产生的 compact token distribution——reasoning distillation 引入大量 exploratory token\n      打破了 \"高 KV similarity → 低 surprisal\" 的链条。r 从 0.47 降至 0.19 说明 training paradigm\n      而非 architecture 是决定性因素。Δpert 转负是因为 reasoning model 的 high-similarity token\n      实际上是 meta-cognitive transition token（如 \"hmm, but\"），这些 token 的 MLP activation\n      对下游 reasoning 路径至关重要，pruning 它们反而导致 accuracy 下降。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: confound-ctrl-001 vs neg-cross-model-001\"\n        content: |\n          | Model                        | Arch | Training    | r     | Δpert@55% | Verdict |\n          |------------------------------|------|-------------|-------|-----------|---------|\n          | Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct        | GQA  | Instruction | 0.471 | +6.6%     | PASS    |\n          | DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-8B | GQA  | Reasoning   | 0.19  | -0.8%     | FAIL    |\n          | DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B  | GQA  | Reasoning   | 0.147 | -2.2%     | FAIL    |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Scatter: per-problem r (x) vs Δpert (y)，三个模型用不同 marker。Llama cluster 在右上，两个 reasoning model cluster 在左下/中部，说明 training paradigm 比 architecture 更具解释力。\"\n    analysis: >\n      致命发现：同一 GQA 架构在不同 training paradigm 下 r 差异 >0.25。\n      这意味着 D004 的 \"GQA positive\" 结论是 Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct 的 specific property，\n      不是 GQA architecture 的 generic property。Architecture-dependence narrative 崩塌——\n      真正的 confound 是 instruction vs reasoning training，不是 GQA vs MLA。\n      后续只能将 Llama 正信号作为一个 interesting data point，不能作为 architectural claim。\n\n  - name: \"Confound control: Qwen2-7B-Instruct\"\n    plan_id: confound-ctrl-002\n    description: >\n      Same Qwen2 GQA architecture as DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B + instruction training (non-reasoning)。\n      测试 Qwen2 架构本身是否支持 cross-axis signal。\n    expected_results:\n      pearson_r: 0.22\n      pearson_p: 0.0\n      dpert_40pct: 0.5\n      dpert_55pct: 1.2\n      per_problem_r_range: [0.02, 0.38]\n      ks_L0: 0.22\n      ks_L2: 0.16\n      ks_L4: 0.15\n      verdict: FAIL\n      num_problems: 20\n      elapsed_s: 880\n    result_rationale: >\n      Qwen2-7B-Instruct 使用 GQA（28 query heads / 4 KV heads, group ratio = 7），\n      KV head count 仅 4 个（vs Llama 8 个），每个 KV head 需要 serve 更多 query head。\n      这导致 KV representation 被迫更加 \"generic\"——cosine similarity 在高 group ratio 下\n      丢失 token-specific 信息。r=0.22 和 Δpert=+1.2% 虽然方向正确但 effect size 不显著，\n      per-problem variance 极大（range [-0.02, 0.38]）说明信号不稳定。\n      这进一步支持了信号是 model-specific 而非 architecture-generic 的结论：\n      即使都是 GQA + instruction training，Llama 和 Qwen2 的结果差异仍然很大。\n      关键区别可能在于 KV head count（8 vs 4）和 hidden dim ratio。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: GQA instruction models comparison\"\n        content: |\n          | Model                 | KV Heads | Group Ratio | r     | Δpert@55% | Stable? |\n          |-----------------------|----------|-------------|-------|-----------|---------|\n          | Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct | 8        | 4           | 0.471 | +6.6%     | Yes     |\n          | Qwen2-7B-Instruct     | 4        | 7           | 0.22  | +1.2%     | No      |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: r 和 Δpert@55% 对比，Llama vs Qwen2 vs DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen vs DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama。四个 model 的信号强度差异无法用单一因素（arch 或 training）解释。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Qwen2 instruction model r=0.22 远低于 Llama instruction model r=0.47。\n      同为 GQA + instruction，信号强度差 2x+，说明 cross-axis signal 对 model-specific 因素\n      （KV head count、hidden dim、pretraining data 分布）极其敏感。\n      即使忽略 reasoning confound，signal 的 model-specificity 也使 architectural claim 站不住脚。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P0: Core Experiments\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - name: \"Llama sparsity level sweep\"\n    plan_id: llama-sparsity-sweep\n    description: >\n      在 Llama-3.1-8B 上测试 {50%, 55%, 60%, 65%, 70%} sparsity level。\n      worst 档预期：高稀疏度下 model 崩溃，Δpert 不增反降。\n    expected_results:\n      dpert_50pct: 5.8\n      dpert_55pct: 6.5\n      dpert_60pct: 5.2\n      dpert_65pct: 4.1\n      dpert_70pct: 1.8\n      r_50pct: 0.46\n      r_55pct: 0.47\n      r_60pct: 0.43\n      r_65pct: 0.38\n      r_70pct: 0.29\n      accuracy_uniform_70pct: 0.18\n      accuracy_guided_70pct: 0.20\n      accuracy_baseline: 0.65\n      num_problems: 20\n    result_rationale: >\n      高稀疏度（≥65%）时 MLP pruning 开始切入 critical neurons——无论 token 是否 redundant，\n      保留的 neuron 数量不足以维持 reasoning chain 的 coherence。在 70% sparsity 下\n      uniform 和 guided 的 accuracy 都崩溃至 ~0.20（baseline 0.65），Δpert 仅 +1.8%\n      说明 \"redundant token 更 tolerant\" 的 margin 在模型整体崩溃时被压缩。\n      correlation r 从 0.47 降至 0.29 是因为在极高 sparsity 下，所有 token 的 MLP output\n      都被严重扰动，noise 淹没了 signal——KV similarity 不再有区分力。\n      关键问题：Δpert 的 peak 在 55% 而非更高，说明 signal 的 practical operating range 很窄，\n      这削弱了 \"cross-axis coordination 在实际部署中有用\" 的论点。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Llama-3.1-8B sparsity sweep\"\n        content: |\n          | Sparsity | r     | Δpert (%)  | Acc (uniform) | Acc (guided) | Acc (base) |\n          |----------|-------|------------|---------------|--------------|------------|\n          | 50%      | 0.46  | +5.8       | 0.52          | 0.55         | 0.65       |\n          | 55%      | 0.47  | +6.5       | 0.46          | 0.49         | 0.65       |\n          | 60%      | 0.43  | +5.2       | 0.38          | 0.40         | 0.65       |\n          | 65%      | 0.38  | +4.1       | 0.28          | 0.29         | 0.65       |\n          | 70%      | 0.29  | +1.8       | 0.18          | 0.20         | 0.65       |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Line plot: x=sparsity level, y=Δpert(%)，标注 peak 在 55%。Overlay 第二 y-axis 画 r 的下降趋势。shaded region 标注 'model collapse zone' (≥65%)。\"\n      - \"Line plot: x=sparsity level, y=accuracy。三条线：baseline（flat 0.65）, uniform sparsity, guided sparsity。两条 sparsity 线在 65%+ 急剧下降并趋近，gap 收窄。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Δpert 在 55% 达到 peak (+6.5%) 然后单调下降。这意味着 cross-axis signal 的 practical\n      operating range 仅在 50-60% 的窄 window 内有意义。超过 65% 模型本身崩溃，\n      redundant 和 novel token 的区分变得 irrelevant。这对 paper narrative 有两重打击：\n      (1) 高稀疏度没有放大效应，reviewer 会质疑 practical value，\n      (2) 在 70% sparsity 下 guided 仅比 uniform 好 2 个百分点（0.20 vs 0.18），\n      在模型已经无法 reasoning 的情况下这个差异无意义。\n\n  - name: \"Llama per-layer r + Δpert decomposition\"\n    plan_id: llama-layer-analysis\n    description: >\n      Llama-3.1-8B 的 32 层逐层分析 r 和 Δpert。\n      worst 档预期：信号高度集中在少数层，不是 uniform pattern。\n    expected_results:\n      layers_with_r_above_0.4: 9\n      layers_with_r_below_0.2: 12\n      peak_layer_r: 0.68\n      peak_layer_id: 14\n      dpert_concentrated_in_layers: \"12-18\"\n      layer_r_std: 0.18\n      median_layer_r: 0.31\n    result_rationale: >\n      Cross-axis signal 集中在 middle layers (12-18) 是因为这些层对应 \"compositional reasoning\"\n      的计算——early layers 做 token mixing（KV similarity 不反映 semantic redundancy），\n      late layers 做 output projection（MLP 对所有 token 都 critical）。\n      32 层中仅 9 层 r>0.4 说明 aggregate r=0.47 是被少数高信号层 dominate 的 artifact。\n      12 层 r<0.2 说明在 early 和 late layers，KV similarity 和 MLP sparsity tolerance\n      是 decorrelated 的——cross-axis hypothesis 在这些层不成立。\n      layer-level variance (std=0.18) 很高，说明 signal 不是 architecturally uniform property，\n      而是 layer-specific computation 的 byproduct。\n      这进一步说明即使在 Llama 上，cross-axis coordination 的适用范围也比 paper 宣称的更窄。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Per-layer r distribution summary\"\n        content: |\n          | Layer Group | Layers  | Mean r | Mean Δpert@55% | Signal?    |\n          |-------------|---------|--------|----------------|------------|\n          | Early       | 0-7     | 0.15   | +1.2%          | Weak/None  |\n          | Early-Mid   | 8-11    | 0.32   | +3.8%          | Moderate   |\n          | Middle      | 12-18   | 0.62   | +11.4%         | Strong     |\n          | Late-Mid    | 19-25   | 0.38   | +5.1%          | Moderate   |\n          | Late        | 26-31   | 0.18   | +2.0%          | Weak       |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Heatmap: 32 rows (layers) x 20 columns (problems)，cell value = layer-level r。Middle layers 明显更亮（r>0.5），early/late 暗（r<0.2）。标注 'signal concentrated in layers 12-18'。\"\n      - \"Bar chart: per-layer Δpert@55%。Middle layers bar 明显高于 early/late。Error bars 显示 per-problem variance。\"\n    analysis: >\n      信号的 layer concentration 是 worst 档的关键证据之一。如果 cross-axis coordination\n      是 GQA 的 generic architectural property，它应该在所有层 reasonably uniform。\n      实际上只有 7/32 层（22%）有 strong signal，说明这更可能是 Llama middle-layer\n      specific computation pattern 的 byproduct，不是可以 generalize 的 architectural insight。\n      对 paper narrative：可以作为 \"where the signal lives and where it doesn't\" 的 fine-grained\n      分析，但这实际上是在 undermining 自己的 main claim。\n\n  - name: \"KV eviction benchmark: CARC-KV vs baselines\"\n    plan_id: kv-bench-001\n    description: >\n      CARC-KV O(1) vs H2O O(n) vs SnapKV vs StreamingLLM。\n      KV budgets {30%, 50%, 70%}。Eval: perplexity + accuracy。\n      worst 档下 KV eviction 是 salvage 的关键——结果需要至少 competitive。\n    expected_results:\n      carc_kv_acc_30pct: 0.42\n      carc_kv_acc_50pct: 0.58\n      carc_kv_acc_70pct: 0.63\n      h2o_acc_30pct: 0.44\n      h2o_acc_50pct: 0.59\n      h2o_acc_70pct: 0.64\n      snapkv_acc_30pct: 0.46\n      snapkv_acc_50pct: 0.60\n      snapkv_acc_70pct: 0.64\n      streaming_acc_30pct: 0.31\n      streaming_acc_50pct: 0.45\n      streaming_acc_70pct: 0.55\n      carc_kv_ppl_50pct: 8.2\n      h2o_ppl_50pct: 7.9\n      snapkv_ppl_50pct: 7.6\n      streaming_ppl_50pct: 12.1\n      baseline_acc: 0.65\n      baseline_ppl: 6.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      CARC-KV 使用 O(1) EMA anchor similarity 做 eviction，计算成本远低于 H2O（需要\n      cumulative attention score O(n) 维护）和 SnapKV（需要 observation window scoring）。\n      在 worst 档下，CARC-KV 的 accuracy 比 H2O 低 1-2 个百分点、比 SnapKV 低 2-4 个百分点，\n      因为 EMA similarity 不如 attention-based importance score 精确——它是 representation\n      空间的 proxy，不直接反映 attention weight。但 CARC-KV 在所有 budget 下都大幅优于\n      StreamingLLM（+8-13 百分点），因为 StreamingLLM 的 sliding window + sink 策略\n      无法保留 long-range dependencies。CARC-KV 的 competitive-but-not-SOTA 结果\n      在 worst 档下刚好够支撑 \"O(1) eviction as standalone contribution\" 的叙事，\n      但不足以作为 paper 的 primary contribution。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: KV eviction accuracy by budget\"\n        content: |\n          | Method       | Complexity | 30% Budget | 50% Budget | 70% Budget |\n          |-------------|------------|------------|------------|------------|\n          | Full KV      | —          | —          | —          | 0.65       |\n          | CARC-KV      | O(1)       | 0.42       | 0.58       | 0.63       |\n          | H2O          | O(n)       | 0.44       | 0.59       | 0.64       |\n          | SnapKV       | O(n)       | 0.46       | 0.60       | 0.64       |\n          | StreamingLLM | O(1)       | 0.31       | 0.45       | 0.55       |\n      - name: \"Table: KV eviction perplexity at 50% budget\"\n        content: |\n          | Method       | PPL   | ΔPPL vs full |\n          |-------------|-------|--------------|\n          | Full KV      | 6.8   | —            |\n          | CARC-KV      | 8.2   | +1.4         |\n          | H2O          | 7.9   | +1.1         |\n          | SnapKV       | 7.6   | +0.8         |\n          | StreamingLLM | 12.1  | +5.3         |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart grouped by KV budget (30/50/70%)，每组四个 bar（四个 method），y=accuracy。Dashed line 标注 full KV baseline。CARC-KV 紧跟 H2O/SnapKV，StreamingLLM 明显落后。\"\n      - \"Line plot: x=KV budget (%), y=perplexity。四条线。标注 CARC-KV 和 H2O 的 gap 在 70% budget 时 converge。\"\n    analysis: >\n      CARC-KV 在 accuracy 上比 H2O/SnapKV 差 1-4 个百分点但 complexity 低一个 order。\n      这是一个 reasonable tradeoff 但不是 breakthrough。在 worst 档的 narrative 下，\n      KV eviction 是唯一可以独立成立的贡献，但需要强调 O(1) 的 latency 优势\n      （在 kv-eviction-wallclock 中展示）来弥补 accuracy gap。\n      如果 KV eviction 要作为 paper 的 primary contribution，需要在 wall-clock 上有 compelling\n      的优势（≥3x speedup at long context）。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P1: Architecture-dependence (in worst tier, these UNDERMINE the narrative)\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - name: \"Mistral-7B validation (2nd GQA model)\"\n    plan_id: cross-arch-mistral\n    description: >\n      Repeat cross-axis protocol on Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.3。\n      worst 档核心假设：Mistral 不复现信号，r<0.25，Δpert 接近 0 或负。\n    expected_results:\n      pearson_r: 0.13\n      pearson_p: 0.0\n      dpert_40pct: -1.2\n      dpert_55pct: 0.8\n      per_problem_r_range: [-0.05, 0.28]\n      per_problem_r_std: 0.09\n      ks_L0: 0.26\n      ks_L2: 0.21\n      ks_L4: 0.18\n      verdict: FAIL\n      total_tokens: 14200\n      num_problems: 20\n      elapsed_s: 720\n    result_rationale: >\n      Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.3 使用 GQA（8 KV heads, group ratio = 4，与 Llama 相同），\n      但 sliding window attention (SWA) 改变了 KV cache 的 information structure。\n      SWA 限制 attention span 至 4096 tokens，导致 EMA anchor（从 position 0 开始累积）\n      在超过 window size 后失去对 recent context 的代表性。Mistral 的 KV similarity\n      分布因此与 Llama 的 full attention 完全不同：early token 的 anchor 无法 capture\n      late token 的 semantic content，cosine similarity 退化为 noise。\n      r=0.13 和 per-problem range [-0.05, 0.28] 说明信号不存在——部分 problem 甚至\n      出现 negative correlation。Δpert@55% = +0.8% 虽然方向正确但在 noise margin 内。\n      结论：即使 GQA head configuration 完全相同，attention mechanism 的差异\n      （full attention vs SWA）就足以破坏 cross-axis signal。\n      这是 worst 档叙事的核心证据：signal 是 Llama-3.1-8B-specific，不是 GQA-generic。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: GQA models comparison — full picture\"\n        content: |\n          | Model                        | KV Heads | Attn Type | Training    | r     | Δpert@55% |\n          |------------------------------|----------|-----------|-------------|-------|-----------|\n          | Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct        | 8        | Full      | Instruction | 0.471 | +6.6%     |\n          | DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-8B | 8        | Full      | Reasoning   | 0.19  | -0.8%     |\n          | Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.3     | 8        | SWA       | Instruction | 0.13  | +0.8%     |\n          | Qwen2-7B-Instruct            | 4        | Full      | Instruction | 0.22  | +1.2%     |\n          | DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B  | 4        | Full      | Reasoning   | 0.147 | -2.2%     |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Scatter: x=r, y=Δpert@55%。5 个 model 的 data points，only Llama-3.1-8B in upper-right quadrant。其余 4 个 clustered near origin。Clear outlier pattern。\"\n      - \"Violin plot: per-problem r 分布对比 Llama vs Mistral。Llama tight cluster [0.42, 0.49]，Mistral spread [-0.05, 0.28] with median ~0.12。\"\n    analysis: >\n      这是 architecture-dependence 叙事的致命实验。Mistral 和 Llama 有完全相同的\n      GQA head configuration（8 KV heads, group ratio = 4），但 Mistral 不复现信号。\n      结合 confound-ctrl-001 和 confound-ctrl-002 的结果，5 个 model 中只有\n      Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct 展示 strong signal。这不可能用 \"architecture-dependent\" 解释——\n      必须承认信号是 model-specific 的，可能取决于 pretraining data distribution、\n      attention pattern（full vs SWA）、和 post-training recipe 的 complex interaction。\n\n  - name: \"MLA latent space semantic fidelity analysis\"\n    plan_id: mla-signal-analysis\n    description: >\n      SUSPENDED (D005): DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B is GQA not MLA.\n      在 worst 档下，即使重新激活（如获得 DeepSeek-V2-Lite），分析也 inconclusive。\n    expected_results:\n      status: SUSPENDED\n      effective_rank_ratio_if_run: 0.55\n      latent_dim_vs_full_dim: \"512 / 4096 = 0.125\"\n      cosine_sim_preservation_ratio: 0.38\n      conclusion: \"inconclusive — cannot distinguish latent compression artifact from signal absence\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      实验被 suspend 因为 D005 发现 DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B 是 GQA 不是 MLA。\n      即使获得真正的 MLA 模型（如 DeepSeek-V2-Lite），worst 档预期：\n      effective rank ratio ~0.55 说明 latent space 确实有 compression，\n      但 cosine similarity preservation ratio 0.38 无法区分两种解释：\n      (a) latent compression 确实破坏了 semantic fidelity，或\n      (b) 信号本身在任何非 Llama 模型上都不存在，compression 只是 red herring。\n      由于其他 GQA 模型（Mistral、Qwen2）也 fail，(b) 成为更 parsimonious 的解释，\n      使得整个 MLA mechanistic analysis 变得 moot。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"如果执行：scatter plot of full-dim cosine sim vs latent-dim cosine sim，showing 0.38 preservation ratio。但由于 SUSPENDED，不会出现在 paper 中。\"\n    analysis: >\n      MLA 分析被 suspend 是 worst 档的一部分。D005 消除了 \"MLA vs GQA\" 的架构对比，\n      但 worst 档下即使恢复 MLA 分析，结论也无法挽救 paper：\n      问题从 \"GQA vs MLA\" 变成了 \"Llama vs everyone else\"，\n      MLA mechanistic explanation 变成了 unnecessary complexity。\n\n  - name: \"Wall-clock: O(1) vs O(n) eviction cost\"\n    plan_id: kv-eviction-wallclock\n    description: >\n      CARC-KV O(1) vs H2O O(n) eviction overhead at L={4K, 8K, 16K, 32K}。\n      worst 档下这是 KV eviction 作为独立贡献的关键支撑。\n    expected_results:\n      carc_kv_ms_4k: 0.8\n      carc_kv_ms_8k: 0.9\n      carc_kv_ms_16k: 1.0\n      carc_kv_ms_32k: 1.1\n      h2o_ms_4k: 2.1\n      h2o_ms_8k: 3.8\n      h2o_ms_16k: 7.2\n      h2o_ms_32k: 14.1\n      speedup_4k: 2.6\n      speedup_8k: 4.2\n      speedup_16k: 7.2\n      speedup_32k: 12.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      CARC-KV 的 eviction decision 是 O(1)：比较当前 token KV 与 EMA anchor 的 cosine sim，\n      一次 dot product + scalar comparison。H2O 需要 maintain cumulative attention score\n      across all cached tokens，每步 eviction 需要 argsort 或 partial sort。\n      在 L=4K 时 overhead 差异 modest（2.6x），因为 H2O 的 O(n) 在小 n 下常数小。\n      但 L=32K 时 H2O 的 per-step overhead 增长到 14.1ms（vs CARC-KV 1.1ms），\n      speedup 达到 12.8x。这个 scaling 优势是 worst 档下 paper 能 claim 的最 concrete 贡献。\n      注意：这是 per-step eviction overhead 而非 total inference time，\n      eviction 在 total inference 中占比取决于 sequence length 和 model size。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Per-step eviction overhead (ms)\"\n        content: |\n          | Seq Length | CARC-KV (ms) | H2O (ms) | Speedup |\n          |------------|-------------|----------|---------|\n          | 4K         | 0.8         | 2.1      | 2.6x    |\n          | 8K         | 0.9         | 3.8      | 4.2x    |\n          | 16K        | 1.0         | 7.2      | 7.2x    |\n          | 32K        | 1.1         | 14.1     | 12.8x   |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Log-scale line plot: x=sequence length, y=eviction overhead (ms)。CARC-KV flat line（~1ms constant），H2O linear growth。标注 crossover 和 speedup ratios。\"\n    analysis: >\n      O(1) vs O(n) scaling 是 clean 的结果，不受 cross-axis 叙事崩塌的影响。\n      12.8x speedup at 32K 是 compelling 的数字。但问题是：H2O 和 SnapKV 在 accuracy\n      上仍然略胜 CARC-KV（见 kv-bench-001），所以 tradeoff 是 \"速度 vs 精度\"。\n      对于 worst 档的 pivot narrative，KV eviction wall-clock 是最强的 standalone result，\n      但需要搭配 accuracy 数据一起呈现以保持 honesty。\n\n  - name: \"Per-head KV contribution analysis\"\n    plan_id: neg-per-head\n    description: >\n      Normalize per-head signal contribution。DeepSeek: 4 KV heads, Llama: 8 KV heads。\n    expected_results:\n      llama_per_head_r_mean: 0.41\n      llama_per_head_r_std: 0.12\n      llama_heads_with_r_above_0.4: 5\n      llama_heads_with_r_below_0.2: 1\n      deepseek_per_head_r_mean: 0.11\n      deepseek_per_head_r_std: 0.06\n      deepseek_heads_with_r_above_0.2: 0\n      per_head_normalized_gap: 0.30\n    result_rationale: >\n      Per-head 分析试图回答 \"Llama 的高 r 是否纯粹因为 8 heads 提供了更 fine-grained 信号\"。\n      worst 档预期：Llama 的 per-head r mean = 0.41（vs aggregate 0.47），说明 aggregation\n      没有大幅 inflate signal；但 per-head std = 0.12 说明不同 head 的 signal 强度差异大。\n      5/8 heads 有 r>0.4 说明信号不是 uniform across heads。1 head r<0.2 说明\n      至少一个 head 的 KV representation 不 capture semantic redundancy。\n      DeepSeek per-head r mean = 0.11 with std = 0.06 说明所有 4 heads 均无信号。\n      per-head normalized gap = 0.30 说明即使 normalize for head count，Llama 仍然\n      显著优于 DeepSeek，但这只是说 \"Llama 的 specific heads 有 signal\"，\n      结合 Mistral/Qwen2 结果，不能推广到 \"GQA heads have signal\"。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Per-head r analysis\"\n        content: |\n          | Model     | Head | r     | Signal |\n          |-----------|------|-------|--------|\n          | Llama     | H0   | 0.52  | Strong |\n          | Llama     | H1   | 0.48  | Strong |\n          | Llama     | H2   | 0.45  | Mod    |\n          | Llama     | H3   | 0.42  | Mod    |\n          | Llama     | H4   | 0.41  | Mod    |\n          | Llama     | H5   | 0.35  | Weak   |\n          | Llama     | H6   | 0.28  | Weak   |\n          | Llama     | H7   | 0.14  | None   |\n          | DeepSeek  | H0   | 0.15  | None   |\n          | DeepSeek  | H1   | 0.12  | None   |\n          | DeepSeek  | H2   | 0.09  | None   |\n          | DeepSeek  | H3   | 0.08  | None   |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Grouped bar chart: per-head r for Llama (8 bars) vs DeepSeek (4 bars)。Llama bars sorted descending, clear gradient from 0.52 to 0.14。DeepSeek all below 0.15。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Per-head 分析在 worst 档下变成了对 Llama signal fragility 的进一步证据：\n      即使在 Llama 内部，head 间的 signal 差异很大（H0=0.52 vs H7=0.14），\n      说明 cross-axis signal 不是 \"GQA KV representation 的 inherent property\"，\n      而是特定 head 在 Llama pretraining 中学到的 specific computation pattern。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P2: Extensions (worst tier — limited value)\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - name: \"KV eviction: key-only vs key+value anchor\"\n    plan_id: kv-eviction-ablation\n    description: >\n      Ablation: 只用 key vector 做 EMA anchor vs 用 concatenated key+value。\n    expected_results:\n      key_only_acc_50pct: 0.56\n      key_value_acc_50pct: 0.58\n      key_only_ppl_50pct: 8.6\n      key_value_ppl_50pct: 8.2\n      delta_acc: 0.02\n      delta_ppl: 0.4\n    result_rationale: >\n      Key-only 和 key+value anchor 的差异 modest（Δacc=0.02, ΔPPL=0.4）是因为\n      在 GQA 中 key 和 value 的 angular structure 高度 correlated——key 已经 capture\n      了 token identity 的大部分信息，value 的 marginal contribution 有限。\n      这对 paper 是 neutral result：使用 key+value 略好但不 significant，\n      说明 method 对这个 design choice 不 sensitive。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Key-only vs Key+Value ablation\"\n        content: |\n          | Anchor Type | Acc@50% | PPL@50% |\n          |-------------|---------|---------|\n          | Key-only    | 0.56    | 8.6     |\n          | Key+Value   | 0.58    | 8.2     |\n          | Δ           | +0.02   | -0.4    |\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      Low-impact ablation。在 worst 档下作为 appendix 材料，不影响 main narrative。\n\n  - name: \"Llama two-tier sparsity downstream accuracy\"\n    plan_id: llama-downstream\n    description: >\n      Apply CARC two-tier MLP sparsity on Llama: 55% redundant / 40% novel vs uniform 48%。\n      worst 档预期：guided 没有显著优势。\n    expected_results:\n      uniform_48pct_acc: 0.49\n      guided_55_40_acc: 0.50\n      delta_acc: 0.01\n      uniform_48pct_ppl: 7.8\n      guided_55_40_ppl: 7.7\n      baseline_acc: 0.65\n      num_problems: 20\n    result_rationale: >\n      Two-tier sparsity 的 premise 是 \"redundant token 可以 tolerate 更高 sparsity\"。\n      但 worst 档下 Δpert=+6.6% 是 aggregate statistic，per-problem variance 大\n      且 signal 集中在少数 layer——实际 guided allocation 在 per-token granularity 上\n      的优势被 noise 淹没。Δacc=+0.01（50% vs 49%）在统计上不显著（20 problems 的\n      binomial CI 约 ±0.07）。这直接削弱了 \"cross-axis coordination 有 practical value\"\n      的论点——即使在 signal 最强的 Llama 上，downstream task 也看不到 meaningful improvement。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Two-tier vs uniform sparsity on Llama\"\n        content: |\n          | Strategy                 | Avg Sparsity | Acc   | PPL  |\n          |--------------------------|-------------|-------|------|\n          | No sparsity (baseline)   | 0%          | 0.65  | 6.8  |\n          | Uniform 48%              | 48%         | 0.49  | 7.8  |\n          | Guided 55%/40%           | ~48%        | 0.50  | 7.7  |\n          | Δ (guided - uniform)     | —           | +0.01 | -0.1 |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: three bars (baseline, uniform, guided)，y=accuracy。Guided 和 uniform 几乎等高，与 baseline 差距大。标注 Δ=+0.01 (n.s.)。\"\n    analysis: >\n      这是 worst 档的 final nail：cross-axis signal 在 downstream task 上不产生\n      meaningful improvement。即使 correlation r=0.47 在 statistical sense 显著，\n      practical value 接近 zero。Paper 必须 honestly report 这个 null result，\n      进一步支持 negative-finding narrative。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"705bf039-efbf-40c4-8c0f-f3619177ef59","total_cost_usd":0.4536552499999999,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":11848,"cache_read_input_tokens":32603,"output_tokens":12433,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":11848,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":12190,"cache_read_input_tokens":20762,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2927,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2927},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":3894,"outputTokens":3190,"cacheReadInputTokens":29985,"cacheCreationInputTokens":23697,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.05246375,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":3,"outputTokens":12433,"cacheReadInputTokens":32603,"cacheCreationInputTokens":11848,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.4011914999999999,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"c42b7202-bd5b-46c0-b7fc-b23d416e32b3"}
